OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FScattered
OL,6,Fslight showers and clear spells
OL,7,Fthrough the evening. Showers mostly
OL,8,Ffade out overnight but it will remain
OL,9,Frather cloudy. Fresh occasionally
OL,10,Fstrong northerly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FIt will be cool and cloudy
OL,13,Fthroughout the day but staying dry.
OL,14,FNorth to northwest winds easing during
OL,15,Fthe afternoon.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,18,FSaturday and Sunday will see a few
OL,19,Fsunny intervals along with some
OL,20,Fshowers. Dry with bright or sunny
OL,21,Fspells on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
